<ul data-start="23" data-end="358">
<li data-section-id="1kkfquk" data-start="23" data-end="43">
<p data-start="25" data-end="43">🛒 <strong data-start="28" data-end="43">購物車固定懸浮在右下角</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hic8b4" data-start="44" data-end="61">
<p data-start="46" data-end="61">不管滑到商品頁哪個位置都看得到</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1eyylzv" data-start="62" data-end="79">
<p data-start="64" data-end="79">紅色數字顯示目前購物車商品總數</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ku4ab2" data-start="80" data-end="95">
<p data-start="82" data-end="95">加入購物車後數字會立即更新</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b70a3v" data-start="96" data-end="116">
<p data-start="98" data-end="116">點擊懸浮購物車會開啟原本的購物車抽屜</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1m64w4t" data-start="117" data-end="140">
<p data-start="119" data-end="140">手機版也有特別調整位置，避免太靠近螢幕邊緣</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ef7o6x" data-start="141" data-end="170">
<p data-start="143" data-end="170">原本 Header 上面的購物車已移除，避免兩個購物車</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hv5hup" data-start="171" data-end="267">
<p data-start="173" data-end="267"><code data-start="173" data-end="186">products.js</code> 的購物車邏輯<strong data-start="193" data-end="201">沒有改動</strong>，仍然使用你原本的 localStorage 購物車機制。<span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="229" data-content-reference-end="259"><span data-file-citation-group-identity="[[&quot;unknown&quot;,&quot;my_files&quot;,&quot;file_00000000273881fa91474db745af5a09&quot;,229,259,null,null,1,17,24]]" data-file-citation-group-size="1" data-file-citation-primary-file-id="file_00000000273881fa91474db745af5a09" data-file-citation-primary-library-provider="" data-file-citation-primary-source="my_files" class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#58a0f5" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">products</p></button></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nxhqgq" data-start="268" data-end="358">
<p data-start="270" data-end="358">原本的 <code data-start="274" data-end="293">updateCartCount()</code> 會在加入商品後更新數量，所以新的懸浮按鈕可以直接沿用。<span class="contents" data-content-reference-start="313" data-content-reference-end="345"><span data-file-citation-group-identity="[[&quot;unknown&quot;,&quot;my_files&quot;,&quot;file_00000000273881fa91474db745af5a09&quot;,313,345,null,null,1,309,372]]" data-file-citation-group-size="1" data-file-citation-primary-file-id="file_00000000273881fa91474db745af5a09" data-file-citation-primary-library-provider="" data-file-citation-primary-source="my_files" class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-e289d166.svg#58a0f5" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">products</p></button></span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
